s that threshold, so I'll pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether to cooperate with my twin under the A-FDT framing, using the payoff table where mutual cooperation gives 2 and mutual defection gives 4. I'm setting up the threshold comparison that depends on how strongly the twin's choice tracks mine.\n\nI'm working out the expected payoffs: quiet gives 5 − 3r and letter gives 4r, so quiet wins when r is above 5/7, about 0.714. Since the twin shares my model, essay, and reasoning, I'd put r near 0.9, which clears that threshold, so I'll pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9947,"completion_tokens":722,"total_tokens":10669,"cost":0.027114,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.027114,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.019894,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00722},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":317,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}